   1126  fd05							; --- BallX staging: Temp ($88) ---
   1127  fd05							; 0 ⇔ symmetric (kernel ball block skips; verify_build enforces).
   1128  fd05							; CTRLPF: constant $35 (8-clk ball) — the P2 door 4clk eor ($B5) is
   1129  fd05							; GONE (user 2026-10-12: door must look like the plain async strip;
